. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Te_RvjexFI4Q7kNvwFzh4vY&_nc_oc=AdlNgCAJo0kra3QTQSZGznCNgR3dk8_KHr8fw57yfI1vE0WHhVPoD517ugpPMSX_lKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz03hmr3ScYHLG9Tjfty-lSjZZbBTtQg7HPkI6bC0Rybg&oe=69AD733E"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cUa6GbmQDCoQ7kNvwHM0QHj&_nc_oc=AdnjOeLx0td18L2cefj9Lyzh48nTQNi8AEwziGaP7VhA3lXEIXnmruMvAn4JOW0228E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw7lWxTmhR69NvKVNNVYcd22ArQU9ofiae5It1fjPc1Xw&oe=69AD89DE"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a1GGLp-fws0Q7kNvwEZV3ij&_nc_oc=AdkH4VX_LjpMbzsxo4dgSvkVWTQwVzk3i6H1-OXSaK2hbFn1KRoR7CzMraigf-hrYpo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwYPKLZjkuY6O1kM4RGjGpPVtbOCchpkAZUUWSQIUz6nA&oe=69AD7F5B"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1